        "title": "Zero Product Property",
        "text": "If $A \\times B \\times C = 0$, then at least one of $A$, $B$, or $C$ must equal zero.\n\nSo if $(x-1)(x-2)(x-3) = 0$, then:\n- $x - 1 = 0$, OR\n- $x - 2 = 0$, OR\n- $x - 3 = 0$",
